                # Let's check: for /tmp/out.tif (no CRS) detailed gave just "GTiff" (no extra). For /tmp/test.geojson detailed gave "GeoJSON, has CRS".
                # So for GTiff without CRS, no extra. For GTiff with CRS, maybe "GTiff, has CRS"? Or "GTiff, has georeferencing"? Let's assume "GTiff" + (", has CRS" if has_crs else "")
